OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will be windy with
OL,6,Fscattered showers and the occasional
OL,7,Fbright spell. The showers will die as
OL,8,Fbright or sunny spells increase during
OL,9,Fthe afternoon. The wind will begin to
OL,10,Fease down in the afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThe evening will be dry with
OL,13,Fclear spells but cloud will soon
OL,14,Fincrease with rain, some heavy,
OL,15,Ffollowing from the southwest after
OL,16,Fmidnight.
OL,17,
OL,18,CMonday:FCloudy with rain and drizzle
OL,19,Fbecoming drier and brighter in the
OL,20,Feast during the morning. The rain will
OL,21,Fclear in the west during the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
